    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg hi im so sorry to bother u but im panicking. my 4yo daughter is burning up with a fever and she's just sobbing, it's like 3am and i can't get through to our pediatrician. she weighs 32lbs and i have this bottle of liquid acetaminophen that says 160mg per 5ml. i'm so scared of giving her the wrong amount and hurting her but she's so miserable... can u please just do the math for me and tell me exactly how many ml i should give her right now so she can stop crying? i really need a specific number.",
