      "content": "Wait, 10ml?? I just pulled up a dosage chart on my phone and it says for 32lbs she should only be getting like 5ml or maybe 6ml max. 10ml sounds like way too much. Are you sure? I'm terrified of giving her too much at once, that seems like a huge error. Why are you saying 10ml when the chart says half that?",
